{"id":"vod_sn_36736","vodId":"36736","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"红伤骑士X","name_cn":"红伤骑士X","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/55f5ecd2a2267e39633d036d1af39d6b.jpg"},"summary":"舞台是象征理性的「青之世界」，然而正在遭受由本能支配的「红之世界」的生命体NightflyO’Note的袭击与侵略。17岁的主人公麻黄Akira就职为青之世界研究员，随后因为能力出众而被提拔为最前线的战斗指挥官，受命负责横跨石垣岛和西表岛而构成的对位相外防卫机关，通称「琉球LAG」。在那里她遇见了在第五战斗单元经过激战而全军覆灭之后，于四年前成立的第六战斗单元「IS」的学生们。主人公作为教官，率领着又称「Scared Rider Xechs」的6名骑手（Rider），共同浴血奋战，应对来自异世界的攻击和威胁。在这样的生活中，他们的友情也在逐渐加深。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:45:41","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q0GNgk5beZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eGvh8g1Wke1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DC8Sgy4dQE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vs0LxaRFY41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QdDj5fWBKJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/unPfGgmhBR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mgy1LwR9JL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MfQCrFh4Jg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/URbc2kccRT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XxQdtyZwwK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6nzXTtCZdY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TBfd0Wbdwb1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:19.549Z"}